   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "When you compare two versions of a file, the tool finds the longest run of lines they share, in order, and shows you the rest as changes. Biologists do the same with DNA. The core problem is the longest common subsequence, and dynamic programming solves it with one table."
